{"about_the_game":"Simple Video Recorder is an extremely easy to use and feature-packed video recording software.  Use this software to record your video games, desktop presentations, for sharing on Youtube, Steam, Vimeo, or anywhere online!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/easy-to-use.png?t=1691097785\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>One click simple recording<br></li><li>High frame-rate supported<br></li><li>Crisp, clean, clear quality video<br></li><li>Full-screen video recording<br></li><li>User-defined video area recording<br></li><li>Captures both system audio as well as microphone audio<br></li><li>Fully supports watermarks / overlay additions</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/header-2.png?t=1691097785\" /><br><br>This software will continually be developed to improve performance, add exciting buttons, and further increase the usability list of features provided!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/header-3.png?t=1691097785\" /><br><br>Easily Add Watermark/Overlay Image:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/ss7.png?t=1691097785\" /><br><br>Full Webcam Support:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/ss6.png?t=1691097785\" /><br><br>Custom Recording Size:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/ss2.png?t=1691097785\" /><br><br>Super Easy Video Settings:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/ss3.png?t=1691097785\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/ss4.png?t=1691097785\" /><br><br>Fantastic Microphone/Audio Support:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/ss1.png?t=1691097785\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/ss5.png?t=1691097785\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1070520?t=1691097785","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1691097785","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1691097785","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1691097785","categories":[{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>PLEASE WISHLIST US!</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/add-wishlist.png?t=1691097785\" /></p><br><h1>About the Software</h1>Simple Video Recorder is an extremely easy to use and feature-packed video recording software.  Use this software to record your video games, desktop presentations, for sharing on Youtube, Steam, Vimeo, or anywhere online!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/easy-to-use.png?t=1691097785\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>One click simple recording<br></li><li>High frame-rate supported<br></li><li>Crisp, clean, clear quality video<br></li><li>Full-screen video recording<br></li><li>User-defined video area recording<br></li><li>Captures both system audio as well as microphone audio<br></li><li>Fully supports watermarks / overlay additions</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset